{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_mnIG0i7BJgh74EADs0hPg","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:24.069232+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_mnIG0i7BJgh74EADs0hPg","html":"<div><p><span><font><span><span>一、学院介绍</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>上海理工大学</span></span><span><span>能源与动力工程学院是目前国内从事能源、动力领域人才培养和科学研究工作的重要单位之一。聚焦国家</span></span></font><font><span><span>“双碳”战略，面向能源动力、高端装备、绿色能源、先进储能产业发展急需，围绕精品本科与研究型学院办学定位，培养能源动力领域高素质创新型人才。</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>学院于二十世纪</span></span></font><span><span>10</span></span><font><span><span>年代设置蒸汽机室和内燃机室</span></span></font><font><span><span>；</span></span></font><span><span>20</span></span><font><span><span>年代设置机械电气科</span></span></font><font><span><span>，</span></span></font><font><span><span>开设汽机等课程</span></span></font><font><span><span>；</span></span></font><span><span>30</span></span><font><span><span>年代设置机电专业</span></span></font><font><span><span>，</span></span></font><font><span><span>开设蒸汽机、煤气发动机、水利发动机等课程；</span></span></font><span><span>50</span></span><font><span><span>年代设置锅炉制造</span></span></font><font><span><span>科</span></span></font><font><span><span>、汽轮机制造</span></span></font><font><span><span>科</span></span></font><font><span><span>；</span></span></font><span><span>1960</span></span><font><span><span>年设置动力机械工程系。</span></span></font><font><span><span>1986</span></span></font><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>9</span></span></font><font><span><span>月，经原机械工业部批准成立上海机械学院动力工程学院</span></span></font><font><span><span>；</span></span></font><span><span>2008</span></span><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>12</span></span></font><font><span><span>月</span></span></font><font><span><span>，</span></span></font><font><span><span>动力工程学院更名为能源与动力工程学院。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>学院</span></span></font><font><span><span>现有能源与动力工程、过程装备与控制工程、新能源科学与工程以及储能科学与工程等</span></span></font><span><span>4</span></span><font><span><span>个本科专业；</span></span></font><font><span><span>拥有</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span><font><span><span>个博士后流动站、</span></span></font><font><span><span>1</span></span></font><font><span><span>个一级学科博士点、</span></span></font><font><span><span>1</span></span></font><font><span><span>个专业博士点、</span></span></font><font><span><span>10</span></span></font><font><span><span>个二级学科博士点，</span></span></font><font><span><span>9</span></span></font><font><span><span>个学术硕士点和</span></span></font><font><span><span>1</span></span></font><font><span><span>个工程硕士点</span></span></font><font><span><span>，</span></span></font><font><span><span>形成了完备的本</span></span></font><font><span><span>-</span></span></font><font><span><span>学</span></span></font><font><span><span>硕</span></span></font><font><span><span>-</span></span></font><font><span><span>专硕</span></span></font><font><span><span>-</span></span></font><font><span><span>学</span></span></font><font><span><span>博</span></span></font><font><span><span>-</span></span></font><font><span><span>专博</span></span></font><font><span><span>人才培养体系。</span></span></font><font><span><span>每年招收近</span></span></font><span><span>400</span></span><font><span><span>名</span></span></font><font><span><span>本科生、</span></span></font><span><span>400</span></span><font><span><span>余名</span></span></font><font><span><span>博士和</span></span></font><font><span><span>硕士研究生</span></span></font><font><span><span>。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>学院获第三批全国高校黄大年式教师团队，有中国科学院院士</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span><font><span><span>人（双聘）、澳大利亚工程院院士</span></span></font><font><span><span>2</span></span></font><font><span><span>人，以及国家级教学名师、国家突出贡献中青年专家、国家百千万工程人才、全国优秀科技工作者、上海市优秀学术带头人、东方学者、</span></span></font><font><span><span>东方英才、</span></span></font><font><span><span>曙光学者等高端人才</span></span></font><span><span>40</span></span><font><span><span>余人次。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>学院紧密对接国家重大战略需求，形成了叶轮机械流动控制及检测技术、智慧清洁能源技术与装备、制冷低温创新技术与装备、新能源材料与储能技术等特色研究方向，拥有上海市动力工程多相流动与传热重点实验室等省部级重点平台</span></span></font><span><span>7</span></span><font><span><span>个。长期与中国重燃、中船重工、</span></span></font><font><span><span>上海电气等能源动力龙头企业开展产学研合作和技术转移，获国家自然科学二等奖、科技进步二等奖等国家级奖项</span></span></font><span><span>4</span></span><font><span><span>项，上海市技术发明一等奖等省部级奖项</span></span></font><font><span><span>100</span></span></font><font><span><span>余项。近</span></span></font><font><span><span>3</span></span></font><font><span><span>年承担国自然重点项目、</span></span></font><font><span><span>工信部</span></span></font><font><span><span>“两机”专项、“两机”基础科学</span></span></font><font><span><span>中心重大重点项目等国家级项目</span></span></font><span><span>70</span></span><font><span><span>余项。</span></span></font></p><p><span><font><span><br/></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>二、夏令营介绍</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>能源与动力学院</span></span></font><span><span>2025</span></span><font><span><span>年全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></span></font><font><span><span>诚挚邀请</span></span></font><font><span><span>相关专业本科生报名参加。</span></span></font><font><span><span>夏令营</span></span></font><font><span><span>学员将与</span></span></font><font><span><span>学院老师、研究生学长</span></span></font><font><span><span>进行深入的交流，拓展专业视野，提高学术素养。</span></span></font></p><p><font><span><span>1. </span></span></font><b><font><span><span>基本信息</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><font><span><span>开营时间：</span></span></font><span><span>2025</span></span><font><span><span>年</span></span></font><font><span><span>7</span></span></font><font><span><span>月</span></span></font><font><span><span>3</span></span></font><font><span><span>日</span></span></font><font><span><span>（星期四）</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>活动方式：线下</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>招生规模：</span></span></font><span><span>100</span></span><font><span><span>人</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><b><span><span>2. </span></span></b><b><font><span><span>申请条件</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span><font><span><span>）热爱祖国，品德良好，身心健康，在校期间无违纪行为、未受过处分；</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>2</span></span><font><span><span>）</span></span></font><font><span><span>动力工程及工程热物理、航空宇航科学与技术相关专业三年级在校本科生（</span></span></font><span><span>2026</span></span><font><span><span>届本科毕业生）；</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>（</span></span></font><span><span>3</span></span><font><span><span>）学习成绩优秀，有较好的专业素养和较强的创新能力。</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><b><span><span>3. </span></span></b><b><font><span><span>活动日程安排</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><table><tbody><tr><td><p><b><span><font><span><span>时间</span></span></font></span></b><b><span></span></b></p></td><td><p><b><span><font><span><span>活动内容</span></span></font></span></b><b><span></span></b></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9:00-9:15</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>开营仪式</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9:15-9:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>学院介绍</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9:30-9:45</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>学术报告</span></span></font><span><span>1</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>9:45-10:00</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>学术报告</span></span></font><span><span>2</span></span></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>10:00-10:15</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>学长经验交流</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>10:15-10:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>休息</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>10:30-11:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>导师互动交流</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>11:30-13:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>午餐、校园参观</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>13:30-15:30</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>课题组组会体验（部分同学</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>、随机抽取</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>）</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span>15:30-15:45</span></span></span><span></span></p></td><td><p><span><font><span><span>结营仪式</span></span></font></span><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span><span>4. </span></span></b><b><font><span><span>活动地点</span></span></font></b><b><span></span></b></p><p><font><span><span>上海理工大学军工路</span></span></font><font><span><span>校区</span></span></font><font><span><span>（上海市杨浦区军工路</span></span></font><font><span><span>5</span></span></font><span><span>16</span></span><font><span><span>号）</span></span></font><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>三、报名方式及时间</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><span><font><span><span>1</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>. </span></span></span><span><font><span><span>报名时间：</span></span></font></span><span><font><span><span>即日起至</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>月</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>日</span></span></font></span><span><span><span>17</span></span></span><span><font><span><span>:00</span></span></font></span><span></span></p><p><font><span><span>2</span>